          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "GFv6u",
              "name": "introText",
              "fill": "#2C2418",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "月瀬庵（以下「当館」）は、お客様の個人情報の保護を重要な責務と考え、以下のとおりプライバシーポリシーを定め、個人情報の適切な取り扱いに努めます。",
              "lineHeight": 2.2,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "300"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "jhPg4",
              "name": "section1",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UsQrS",
                  "name": "sec1Title",
                  "fill": "#2C2418",
                  "content": "1. 個人情報の定義",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif JP",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "0jDmV",
                  "name": "sec1Body",
                  "fill": "#8B7D6B",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "当館が取得する個人情報とは、お名前、ご住所、電話番号、メールアドレス、その他お客様を識別できる情報をいいます。",
                  "lineHeight": 2,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "300"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "psUi6",
              "name": "section2",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "soyqd",
                  "name": "sec2Title",
                  "fill": "#2C2418",
                  "content": "2. 個人情報の収集",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif JP",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "tPAtD",
                  "name": "sec2Body",
                  "fill": "#8B7D6B",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "当館は、以下の場合に個人情報を収集いたします。\n・ご予約のお申し込み時\n・お問い合わせフォームのご利用時\n・メールマガジンのご登録時\n・アンケートへのご回答時",
                  "lineHeight": 2,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "300"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "21jnD",
              "name": "section3",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "IH9ix",
                  "name": "sec3Title",
                  "fill": "#2C2418",
                  "content": "3. 個人情報の利用目的",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Serif JP",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rTK10",
                  "name": "sec3Body",
                  "fill": "#8B7D6B",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "収集した個人情報は、以下の目的で利用いたします。\n・ご予約の確認およびご連絡\n・サービスの提供および改善\n・お問い合わせへのご対応\n・当館からのお知らせやキャンペーン情報のご案内\n・統計データの作成（個人を特定できない形式）",
                  "lineHeight": 2,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans JP",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "300"
                }
              ]
            },
